      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't know if they still apply this to display names but they used to.\n\nDue to that I can't even sign in using my display name because they changed the period (U+002E) to an alternative (U+2024).\n\nTrying to change my name back to what I originally wanted with the period  (U+002E) just results in me being told I can't use the character.\n\nPreferably, I would like to just have my name without any unique symbols but that's a different issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
